# .vercelignore — exclude non-production assets from the deployment payload.
.git
.github
docs/
skills/
# Root-level markdown docs only (README, plans, notes). Do NOT use a bare
# `*.md` here: App Router route folders like app/(llms)/contact.md/ also
# match `*.md`, and excluding them 404s every *.md route in production
# (observed Oct 2026: /contact.md, /services.md, /b2b.md, /shop.md,
# /index.md, /projects.md, /agents.md all 404 while *.txt routes worked).
/*.md
